    ["sound/vo/a/m/bfle_am004.mp3"]="Don't infect me with your curse.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/intro1ajon.mp3"]="In the waning years of the Third Era of Tamriel, a prisoner born on a certain day to uncertain parents was sent under guard without explanation to Morrowind, ignorant of the role he was to play in that nation's history.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am001.mp3"]="What assistance do you require, friend?",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am002.mp3"]="Can I interest you in something?",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am003.mp3"]="You should leave.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am004.mp3"]="Greetings, any interest in my goods?",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am005.mp3"]="My prices are the best in town.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am007.mp3"]="A pleasure looking to buy something.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am008.mp3"]="Buy from me, best quality.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am009.mp3"]="It should go away and die.",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am010.mp3"]="Knowledge you need I have for right price",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am011.mp3"]="finest magics you buy",
    ["sound/vo/a/m/srv_am012.mp3"]="Leave before I eat it.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/flw_bf001.mp3"]="Are you sure you know the way?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/flw_bf003.mp3"]="Thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/flw_bf006.mp3"]="How can I show my appreciation? Oh yes, thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/hlo_bf008.mp3"]="Whatever trouble you've gotten yourself into, you'll have to deal with it yourself.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/hlo_bf009.mp3"]="At least you got half right.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/hlo_bf010.mp3"]="You're half dead.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/op_bf003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/op_bf004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/op_bf005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/op_bf006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/op_bf008.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf001.mp3"]="How do you do, friend? Can I interest you in a potion today?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf002.mp3"]="See something you like.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf003.mp3"]="You are repulsive, please go away.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf004.mp3"]="Nice to see you. Care to look through my selections?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf005.mp3"]="Have a look around.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf006.mp3"]="I don't like you here, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf007.mp3"]="Greetings. How about an upgrade in your look?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf008.mp3"]="You'll find no better selection in town.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf009.mp3"]="Stop bothering me.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf010.mp3"]="Good to see you. Do you need my services?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf011.mp3"]="At your service, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf012.mp3"]="I'm not sure we can do business, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf013.mp3"]="Top quality potions right here.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf014.mp3"]="I've lots of remedies to keep you healthy.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf016.mp3"]="Searching for knowledge? I can help, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf017.mp3"]="I have what you want to know. How much do you have?",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf018.mp3"]="I'm loathe to speak with you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf019.mp3"]="Come out, Lander, let's discuss business.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf020.mp3"]="My selection can't be beat.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf021.mp3"]="with nothing to discuss.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf022.mp3"]="The life of a thief is a hard one. Let me make it easier for you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf023.mp3"]="The finest tools you'll see anywhere, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf024.mp3"]="Do not waste my time.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf025.mp3"]="Look at my selection and let me know if anything interests you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf026.mp3"]="You'll find bargains, I guarantee it.",
    ["sound/vo/b/f/srv_bf027.mp3"]="Shop elsewhere.",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/flw_bm001.mp3"]="Where are you going?",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/flw_bm003.mp3"]="Thank you!",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/flw_bm004.mp3"]="Hey, wait for me!",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/flw_bm006.mp3"]="I'm grateful for your help. Thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/hlo_bm043.mp3"]="Oh dear, why must the poor ones always come to me?",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/hlo_bm044.mp3"]="Oh dear, why must the poor ones always come to me?",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/hlo_bm131.mp3"]="Are you the one known as the Nerevar?",
    ["sound/vo/b/m/op_bm001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
