    ["sound/vo/k/m/srv_km008.mp3"]="Best prices, best selection.",
    ["sound/vo/k/m/srv_km009.mp3"]="Please leave, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/a2-6_azura_01.mp3"]="Nerevar reborn, incarnate. Your first three trials are finished. Now two new trials lie before you. Seek the Ashlander, Ashcans, and the Great House Counselors. Four tribes must name you Nerevarin. Three houses must name you Hortator. My servant, Nebane, Mesa, shall be your guide. And when you are Hortator and Nerevarine, when you have stood before the false gods and freed the heart from its prison, heal my people and restore Morrowind. Do this for me and with my blessing.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/azura end game.mp3"]="You no longer bear the burden of prophecy. You have achieved your destiny. You are free. The doom doemas folly. Lord Dagoth's temptation. The tribunal's seduction. The god's heart freed. The prophecy fulfilled. All fate sealed and sins redeemed. If you have pity, mourn the lost. But let the weeping cease. The blight is gone, and the sun's golden honey gills the land. Hail, Saviour, Hortator, and Nerevarine, your people look to you for protection. Monster and villains, great and small, still threaten the people of Vvardenfell. Enemies and evils abound, yet indomitable will might rid Morrowind of all its ills. For you, our thanks and blessing, our gift and token given, come, take this thing from the hand of God.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/azura leave.mp3"]="Go now, all will fall. Leave as you entered, or you too must fall.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bhlo_raven003.mp3"]="Caw, nevermore.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bhlo_raven004.mp3"]="Caw, I'm freezing my cloak off out here.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_assantus.mp3"]="Thank you, Outlander. You are a kind and generous soul.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_bulfim.mp3"]="Thank you, Outlander. You teach through example. I will not forget this.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_diedog.mp3"]="Die like a dog.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_fg_nchurdamz02.mp3"]="I can smell the stench of the day, Droth. It is here and I will find it.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_fg_nchurdamz03.mp3"]="The beast is near now, very near. Be on your guard.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_fg_nchurdamz04.mp3"]="At last, a means to vanquish Relvesu. The final battle awaits.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_lariennaend.mp3"]="Relvesu is vanquished, yet somehow I feel uneasy. I must investigate these ruins further. You have been a worthy companion. Farewell, my friend.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_lette.mp3"]="Oh, thank you. I will never forget this.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_meetdoom.mp3"]="Prepare to meet your doom, would-be assassin.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bill_nogooddeed.mp3"]="No good deed goes unpunished, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt1.mp3"]="You have arrived the others have been here for days now, and you are the last It is time for my hunt and you are to take part I have chosen only the most worthy to take part in the hunt Carrias of the Imperials Heart Fang of the skull the frost giant Karstag and you have proven yourself a worthy hunter and so you have been given this honor",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt2.mp3"]="You and the others are to find your way to my hunting grounds. Take great care, as only one of you will earn the glory of facing the hunter himself in battle while the blood moonlights the sky. The others have gone ahead, so only you remain to begin. Beware, mounds are about, and they hunger for blood. Perhaps I will see you soon. Now go!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt3.mp3"]="So, you are the one. You have escaped my hounds and beaten back the other challengers. I had rather expected the giant to prevail, but no matter. You have proven yourself a worthy hunter, and you have earned the greatest honor that can be bestowed upon a mortal. You are to be my prey.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt4.mp3"]="I ask you though, what is it that makes a hunter great? Is it his strength, the speed with which he strikes? Or is it his guile, the ability to outwit his prey? Answer me mortal, and decide your fate.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt5.mp3"]="you have chosen and so shall be your fate to face me in all my glory would be less than sporting so you shall face but one of my aspects the one you have chosen time the blood moon sinks low in the sky prepare yourself mortal for now you are the hunted",
    ["sound/vo/misc/bm_wildhunt6.mp3"]="This cannot be! The Blood Moon falls, and the prey still lives! You have defeated my aspect! Return mortal! The Blood Moon will rise again, and my hounds will walk the lands! Let this world enjoy its brief respite, for Hirsin will hunt again!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen birth.mp3"]="Very good. The letter that proceeded, you mentioned you were born under a certain sign. And what would that be?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen class1.mp3"]="Ah yes, we've been expecting you. You'll have to be recorded before you're officially released. There are a few ways we can do this and the choice is yours.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen class2.mp3"]="Interesting. Now before I stamp these papers, make sure this information is correct.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen class3.mp3"]="Show your papers to the captain when you exit to get your release fee.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen class4.mp3"]="Take your papers off the table and go see Captain Gravius.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen dock1.mp3"]="You finally arrived, but our records don't show from where.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen dock2.mp3"]="Great. I'm sure you'll fit right in. Follow me up to the office and they'll finish your release.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen dock3.mp3"]="Head on in.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen door1.mp3"]="You'll go no further until you have your papers.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen door2.mp3"]="Continue through to the next building and talk to Seles Kravius.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa1.mp3"]="On a clear day, you chance upon a strange animal, its leg trapped in a hunter's claw snare. Judging from the bleeding, it will not survive long. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa10.mp3"]="Entering town you find that you are witness to a very well-dressed man running from a crowd He screams to you for help the crowd behind him seems very angry What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa2.mp3"]="One summer afternoon, your father gives you a choice of chores. What would you rather do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa3.mp3"]="Your cousin has given you a very embarrassing nickname and even worse likes to call you it in front of your friends. You have asked him to stop, but he finds it very amusing to watch you blush. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa4.mp3"]="There is a lot of heated discussion at the local tavern over a group of people called telepaths. They've been hired by certain city-state kings. Rumor has it these telepaths read a person's mind and tell their lord whether a follower is telling the truth or not. You believe what?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa5.mp3"]="Your mother sends you to the market with a list of goods to buy. After you finish, you find that by mistake a shopkeeper has given you too much money back in exchange for one of the items. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa6.mp3"]="While in a marketplace, you witness a thief cut a purse from a noble. Even as he does so, the noble notices and calls for the city guards. In his haste to get away, the thief drops the purse near you. Surprisingly, no one seems to notice the bag of coins at your feet. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa7.mp3"]="Your father sends you on a task which you loathe, cleaning the stables. On the way there, pitchfork in hand, you run into your friend from the homestead near your own. He offers to do it for you. In return for a future favor of his choosing, what do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa8.mp3"]="Your mother asks you to help fix the stove. While you're working, a very hot pipe slips its moorings and falls towards her. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargen qa9.mp3"]="While in town, the baker gives you a sweet roll. Delighted, you take it into an alley to enjoy, only to be intercepted by a gang of three other kids your age. The leader demands the sweet roll, or else he and his friends will beat you and take it. What do you do?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenboat1.mp3"]="This is where they want you. Head down to the Doc and I'll show you to the Census Office.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenboat2.mp3"]="Let's go. Move it along.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargendock1.mp3"]="You finally arrived, but our records don't show from where.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargendock2.mp3"]="Great. I'm sure you'll fit right in. Follow me up to the office and they'll finish your release.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargendock3.mp3"]="Head on in.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenname1.mp3"]="Stand up. There you go. You were dreaming. What's your name?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenname2.mp3"]="Not even last night's storm could wake you. I heard them say we've reached Morrowind. I'm sure they'll let us go",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenname3.mp3"]="Quiet, here comes the guard.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenname4.mp3"]="You better do what they say.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenwalk1.mp3"]="This is where you get off. Come with me.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenwalk2.mp3"]="Get yourself up on deck and let's keep this as civil as possible.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenwalk3.mp3"]="On Deck, Now Prisoner.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenwoman1.mp3"]="The sooner you leave, the sooner we can move on.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/chargenwoman2.mp3"]="Yes? Confused? We're all waiting.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_azuracomplete.mp3"]="Well done, mortal. You have preserved the integrity of my great Jew with Sheogoth. Now it will end as fated, and not due to the meddling of the Daedra Prince. Take this. Use it wisely.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_azurafail.mp3"]="You have caused me to lose my wager-mortal. Now it matters not that Shea of Oryth meddled in the outcome of our wager. You have failed, but it seems that is your fate.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_azuraintro1.mp3"]="You have come here for a reason, though you may not know what it is. Sheogorth and I have made a wager. He contends that solitude causes madness. While I maintain it allows for solace and meditation. To test this, I sent one of my Christesses to live alone on an island north of Dappenfell. If she can live there for a hundred years, continuing her life of prayer, My theory will be proven. If not, Shana Garth wins our wager.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_azuraintro2.mp3"]="The time has almost passed, and she remains steadfast. But Sheikoroth has tried to sway the decision in his favor. Travel there, rid the island of his minions, and bring back proof of his meddling. Do not disturb the wise woman, though, as that would void our wager. Serve me, and I will reward you well.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_boethiahcomplete.mp3"]="You have done well. The shrine is a worthy one. But my power will again be felt. Take this mortal. wield the gold brand with a strong hand and let all know that my shrine has risen.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_boethiahintro1.mp3"]="What do you want with me, mortal? My shrine is in ruins. My priests have forgotten me. Will you rebuild my shrine, mortal? Restore it in all its glory? Accomplish this, and I will reward you. You will be the bearer of Golbrand, my sword of legend. There is one who can help you do this for me. Listen.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_boethiahintro2.mp3"]="Rough hands to smooth stone, carving rock instead of bone. In caldera an artist waits, his masterpiece to create. Find the one who may shape the rock. Go!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_malacathcomplete.mp3"]="You have killed the false hero, having shared there will be no more to follow. You have hit bring back honor to the obvious people, and for that, I'm glad. Here, take the hell of a boring bear claw, wear it proudly, and let it serve as a reminder of what really happened.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_malacathintro1.mp3"]="You have summoned me, Orc? Have you come to restore the honor of your people? I have in my position the helm of Boring Bearclaw, the dark elephant hero. His deeds are numerous when he was a false hero. They were performed by Karat Brokhar, his orcish friend. His time as legend of this hero was put to rest. Find the last of his bloodline, kill him, and I will grant you the helm. But find the city where the man god lives.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_malacathintro2.mp3"]="You have summed me! HONK! You are all the same. But perhaps you can be of use to me. I have in my possession the hymn of Aurion Bearclaw, the Dark Elven hero. His deeds are numerous, but he was a false hero. All were performed by Kharag Brokar, his work is trained. His time, this legend, was put to rest. the last of his bloodline. Heal him, and I will grant you the helm. Look for him in the city where the man God lives.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_mehruneschoice1.mp3"]="You are brave, or foolish. Perhaps both. This, then, is your chance to prove your courage. My razor, slayer of man and myrrh, scourge of all who stand before it, lies dormant, stolen by an unworthy bearer, an elf of little courage or consequence. It lies unused, gathering dust in the Elast tomb near Molag Mar. Return it to me, mortal. Prove yourself to be a worthy bearer of my rune's razor.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_mehruneschoice2.mp3"]="I expected little else. Take your leave on this place, or die where you stand.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_mehrunescomplete.mp3"]="You found my razor. Good. Can you feel its hunger? Can you feel its frustration? Now I will make it again what it once was. What it shall always be. Draw a line of blood across the land in the name of Mehrunes Dagon!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_mehrunesintro.mp3"]="Why do you call on me, little mortal? Do you seek your death so soon? I should crush you where you stand. Yet you show mettle by even approaching me. How ambitious are you, little one? Would you like a chance to prove your worth to me?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_mephalacomplete.mp3"]="You have done well, mortal. There are some things that must be done to preserve the order, and it will be amusing for me when this business comes to light. I look forward to it. Take this ring, mortal. Through the brightest day, it will carry you with speed and stealth. Leave me now.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_molagbalcomplete.mp3"]="You have freed the soul of Mentil Naar. Torment will be his. Endless agony is all you will know until the end of time. You have performed well, mortal. Perhaps you will be my servant again one day. Take this and use it well. Bring strife and discord with you wherever you may travel. Now, go!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_molagbalintro1.mp3"]="Why do you summon me now? I have no time for your pleadings, weakling. I have other matters that need my attention. Mentana! He will pay for his insolence. Listen well. Those in my service will do my bidding, or they will suffer eternal torment. You will serve me, mortal.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_molagbalintro2.mp3"]="Mentenar has grown careless and lazy. He sits in his wretched cave while light from the surface goes on, unmolested. He was spawned a creature of terror. His role is to sow fear and discord among men and mer. Yet he is content to stay locked in his cave and mock my will.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_molagbalintro3.mp3"]="Kill him, mortal. Set his soul flying to the outer realms so that I might show him eternal torture for his disobedience. Take this key. You will find him in the caves of Koradur, east of Kog'gurum. Kill this lazy fool from immortal. Do this and you will have my favor.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_sheogorathcomplete.mp3"]="I see you have completed my little errand. Well done. Perhaps you've gotten a taste of madness as well? Do not believe madness to be a curse, mortal. For some, it is the greatest of blessings. A bitter mercy, perhaps, but mercy nonetheless. Give me the fork of horopilation. I believe I have something more suitable for your needs. Go now. Remember what you have seen.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_sheogorathintro.mp3"]="What is it, mortal? Have you come to be of service to Shigaroth? That in and of itself speaks toward your madness. This pleases me. Fetch the fork of Horopilation from the Mad Hermit near Aldredegna. Take care with him. He's not the most... stable man.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/da_sheogorathintro2.mp3"]="Use the fork wisely, mortal. Few have wielded it who have not come away changed. Use the fork to strike a death blow to the giant bull-netch that resides near the hermit. Do this. Return the fork of Horopilation to me, and Shegaroth will reward you well.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/dagoth ur welcome a.mp3"]="Dagoth Ur welcomes you, Nerevar, my old friend, but to this place where destiny is made, why have you come unprepared?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/dagoth ur welcome b.mp3"]="Welcome Moon and Star, to this place where destiny is made.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/dagoth ur welcome c.mp3"]="What a fool you are. I'm a god. How can you kill a god? What a grand and intoxicating innocence. How could you be so naive? There is no escape. No recall or intervention can work in this place. Come, lay down your weapons. It is not too late for my mercy.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/dagoth ur welcome d.mp3"]="Ha ha ha! Did you get the false copy of Sundar? Shame on you! Ha ha ha!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/duelbegin.mp3"]="Let the duo begin!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/helsass1.mp3"]="Supposed to be here somewhere?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/helsass2.mp3"]="He told us in the Queen Mother's Chambers!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/helsass3.mp3"]="Behind the screen.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/hit heart 1.mp3"]="What are you doing?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/hit heart 2.mp3"]="What are you doing?",
    ["sound/vo/misc/hit heart 5.mp3"]="Too late.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/hit heart 6.mp3"]="This is the end. The bitter, bitter end.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/itsatrap.mp3"]="It's a trap!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/ms_vampiremolag1.mp3"]="So, you do not enjoy the blood-hungry little leech? Do you miss the warmth of the sun? I can obtain the cure for you. But you will help me first. You will find my daughter, Mola Grunda, in the dungeon Dubtilar below, Mount Asan Bebe. There, she hides with a consort, Consort the lowly I try not know me why being in a sorcerers cave will shield her from my eyes",
    ["sound/vo/misc/ms_vampiremolag2.mp3"]="I ordered her not to associate with these animals. I told her what the penalty would be for her disobedience. Yet, she continues to defy me, willful beast. I cannot have this. Find her mortal, kill her and the Atronach so I may deal with them in the outer realms. When this is done, return to me and I will rid you of your un-life. Take care, mortal, for she is powerful. She is still a daughter of Molag Bal.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/ms_vampiremolag3.mp3"]="I see you have done as I ask, little vampire. It was not easy for me to obtain the cure, but I was able to pry it from Vermina after some discussion. You have earned it. Now I have eternity to punish my daughter for her defiance. Your curse is lifted. Yet under, will you mitaste of blood on your lips. When you sleep, you taste the salt and copper flowing over your tongue. Bask, precious sunlight.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/viv_alm1.mp3"]="I won't let you do that.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/viv_atk1.mp3"]="FOOL EXPLORE!",
    ["sound/vo/misc/viv_atk2.mp3"]="Don't fight gods for more.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/viv_hlo1.mp3"]="Yes, incarnate. I am Phabletic, and I can answer all your questions.",
    ["sound/vo/misc/viv_idl1.mp3"]="This is lonely to be gone.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/atk_nf009.mp3"]="You're bested, Outlander!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/bhlo_nf007.mp3"]="Watch yourself near Eric, friend. He's a swine of a man. It's too bad he's my clan brother.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/bhlo_nf018.mp3"]="In the cave, she met the beast and cut quite short its evil feast And when the eudifrected fall, the chieftain came and claimed her",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/bidl_nf023.mp3"]="Doesn't my ass look big?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/flw_nf001.mp3"]="Are you sure you know the way?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/flw_nf003.mp3"]="Thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/flw_nf004.mp3"]="Hey! Wait for me!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/flw_nf006.mp3"]="How can I show you my appreciation? Ah, yes, thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/hlo_nf131.mp3"]="Nerevar, this is a pleasure.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf007.mp3"]="Seize her!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/op_nf008.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf001.mp3"]="What brings you here today, business or pleasure?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf002.mp3"]="Have a look around. I'm sure you'll like what you see.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf003.mp3"]="Stay away from me, you fool!",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf004.mp3"]="Where would you like to go?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf005.mp3"]="Taking a trip?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf006.mp3"]="I don't deal with the likes of you.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf007.mp3"]="Greetings, Outlander. In need of lockpicks?",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf008.mp3"]="Let us do some business today.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf009.mp3"]="You must be joking. Go away.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf010.mp3"]="Something for the gentleman today.",
    ["sound/vo/n/f/srv_nf011.mp3"]="Something for the lady today?",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/bidl_nm009.mp3"]="Mmm, I smell donuts.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/cratk_nm004.mp3"]="Ugh! Ugh!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/flw_nm003.mp3"]="Thank you, lad.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/flw_nm004.mp3"]="Thank you, Lass!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/hlo_nm131.mp3"]="Hello, Nerevar. A pleasure.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op008.mp3"]="Seize her!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/int_op009.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm001.mp3"]="Good fortune, Outlander. Lookin' for a bargain!",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm002.mp3"]="Freshest ingredients this side of the Ashlands.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm003.mp3"]="Do not waste my time.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm004.mp3"]="Hail, Outlander, I've great prices for you today.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm005.mp3"]="Come, Outlander. Let us do business.",
    ["sound/vo/n/m/srv_nm006.mp3"]="If you touch anything, I'll slice your hand off myself.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/atk_of011.mp3"]="I will kill you quickly.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/flw_of001.mp3"]="Are you sure you know the way?",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/flw_of006.mp3"]="How can I show my appreciation? Ah yes, thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/hlo_of018.mp3"]="We cut off the hand that steals, know this thief.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/hlo_of131.mp3"]="And how shall I call you Nerevar?",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/op_of008.mp3"]="See them!",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/srv_of001.mp3"]="Welcome. I promise you an honest trade.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/srv_of002.mp3"]="I believe you will find what you need. Please, take your time.",
    ["sound/vo/o/f/srv_of003.mp3"]="Get out, you'll give this place a bad name.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/atk_om015.mp3"]="Our blood is made for fighting!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/flw_om001.mp3"]="Is this the way?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/flw_om003.mp3"]="You have my thanks.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/flw_om004.mp3"]="Where are you going?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/flw_om006.mp3"]="I am grateful for your resistance.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/hlo_om014.mp3"]="Hah! You must be blind to dress like that.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/hlo_om015.mp3"]="Herr! You must be blind to dress like that.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/hlo_om131.mp3"]="How shall I call you, Nerevar?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om007.mp3"]="Seize her!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/op_om008.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om001.mp3"]="Shall we do business?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om002.mp3"]="I'm willing to share my insights for the right price.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om003.mp3"]="Do not bother me.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om004.mp3"]="Have you come to train with me?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om005.mp3"]="What skills do you favor?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om006.mp3"]="Bother me again, and I'll rip your arm off.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om007.mp3"]="I offer a good trade, friend. Interested?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om008.mp3"]="I have many bargains. What are you looking for?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om009.mp3"]="I do not have time to deal with you.",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om010.mp3"]="What business can we do today?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om011.mp3"]="Are you here for my services?",
    ["sound/vo/o/m/srv_om012.mp3"]="LEAVE NOW!",
    ["sound/vo/ord/hlo_orm014.mp3"]="Tiding Citizen",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/flw_rf001.mp3"]="Are you sure you know the way?",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/hlo_rf131.mp3"]="Are you the Nerevar? This is an honor.",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/op_rf008.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf001.mp3"]="Can you look at my selection?",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf002.mp3"]="Have a look around. I have a feeling you'll find what you're looking for.",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf003.mp3"]="Maybe you should leave my shop, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf004.mp3"]="Would you like to see our selection?",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf005.mp3"]="Come on in, you won't find a better bargain in town.",
    ["sound/vo/r/f/srv_rf006.mp3"]="Take your money elsewhere.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/atk_rm015.mp3"]="You're done for!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/atk_rm016.mp3"]="I hope you suffer.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/atk_rm017.mp3"]="Run away or die. The choice is yours.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/atk_rm018.mp3"]="It's your last chance. Run or die.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/flw_rm001.mp3"]="Hey, wait, where are you going?",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/flw_rm003.mp3"]="I will remember all you've done for me.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/hlo_rm131.mp3"]="Are you the Nerevar? This is an honor.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/int_op009.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm001.mp3"]="An honor, Outlander. Tell me what you need and I'll try to help.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm002.mp3"]="I am at your service.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm003.mp3"]="It should leave.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm004.mp3"]="It would be an honor to train you today, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm005.mp3"]="Your skills are rusty. Perhaps I can help.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm006.mp3"]="Turn around and do not come back.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm007.mp3"]="The pleasure is all mine, Outlander. Care to barter with me?",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm008.mp3"]="How can I be of service to you, Outlander?",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm009.mp3"]="I do not wish to talk with you.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm010.mp3"]="I have great prices for you today, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm011.mp3"]="You won't find a better bargain in town.",
    ["sound/vo/r/m/srv_rm012.mp3"]="Take your money elsewhere.",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vam006.mp3"]="Oh my god!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vam007.mp3"]="I don't believe it.",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vdm007.mp3"]="Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vhf007.mp3"]="Don't!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vkf014.mp3"]="OH YEAH!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vkm003.mp3"]="That's y'all.",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vkm004.mp3"]="Oh, help me!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vnf004.mp3"]="Oh, God!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vwm005.mp3"]="So bid.",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vwm008.mp3"]="Oh, look at this!",
    ["sound/vo/v/hit_vwm010.mp3"]="I love yous!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/flw_wf001.mp3"]="Are you sure you know the way?",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/flw_wf003.mp3"]="Thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/flw_wf004.mp3"]="Hey, wait for me!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/flw_wf006.mp3"]="How can I show my appreciation? Ah, yes. Thank you.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf001.mp3"]="Grab her!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf007.mp3"]="Seize her!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/op_wf008.mp3"]="Seize him!",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf001.mp3"]="Greetings Outlander, let's get you a new outfit, shall we?",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf002.mp3"]="The latest fashions from the mainland are in.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf003.mp3"]="If you do not leave, I shall call for the guards.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf004.mp3"]="Hail, friend! My finest magics are at your disposal.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf005.mp3"]="No one can beat my prices.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf006.mp3"]="I don't like you, Outlander. Shop elsewhere.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf007.mp3"]="Hail friend, can we do some business today?",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf008.mp3"]="You'll find no better prices in town than with me.",
    ["sound/vo/w/f/srv_wf009.mp3"]="You offend me.",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/flw_wm001.mp3"]="Where are you going?",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/flw_wm003.mp3"]="Thank you!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/hlo_wm130.mp3"]="Those are some serious wounds, Outlander. You should find healing quick!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op002.mp3"]="Grab him!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op003.mp3"]="She's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op004.mp3"]="He's over here!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op005.mp3"]="There he is!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op006.mp3"]="There she is!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op008.mp3"]="Seize her!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/int_op009.mp3"]="It's him!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/intro1addb.mp3"]="In the waning years of the Third Era of Tamriel, a prisoner born on a certain day to uncertain parents was sent under guard without explanation to Morrowind, ignorant of the role he was to play in that nation's history.",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm001.mp3"]="Welcome, Outlander! My freshest ingredients await you!",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm002.mp3"]="You'll find the best prices right here.",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm003.mp3"]="You try my patience, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm004.mp3"]="Looking good, Outlander. Do you require more skill training?",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm005.mp3"]="A bit out of practice. Let me help you, Outlander.",
    ["sound/vo/w/m/srv_wm006.mp3"]="else to help you.",
  },
}
